<rml><head><style>
body, div, h1, h2, p {display:block;}
body {width:100%;height:100%;font-family:Lato;font-size:16px;color:#edf4ff;pointer-events:none;}
#panel {box-sizing:border-box;position:absolute;left:3%;top:4%;width:90%;max-width:640px;max-height:88%;overflow-y:auto;padding:16px;background-color:#102539ee;border:1px #6185a7;pointer-events:auto;}
h1 {font-size:24px;margin:0 0 12px;} h2 {font-size:18px;margin:12px 0 8px;} p {margin:6px 0;}
#badge {width:96px;height:96px;} #landscape {width:100%;max-width:512px;height:auto;}
button {display:inline-block;padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 8px 0 0;background-color:#315b80;color:#ffffff;}
button:hover {background-color:#447da9;} scrollbarvertical {width:12px;} scrollbarvertical sliderbar {background-color:#7199b8;}
</style></head><body><div id="panel"><h1>PNG and JPEG game UI</h1>
<h2>PNG: transparent HUD icon</h2><img id="badge" src="health.png"/>
<p>The circle blends with the panel. Its corners are transparent.</p>
<h2>JPEG: menu artwork</h2><img id="landscape" src="landscape.jpg"/>
<p>Original procedural artwork. Images ship with the exported game.</p>
<p>Tick: {{tick}} | Paused: {{paused}}</p>
<button id="pause" data-event-click="command('Pause')">Pause</button><button id="resume" data-event-click="command('Resume')">Resume</button><button id="step" data-event-click="command('Step')">Step</button>
</div></body></rml>